  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="work" n="224">
        <pb n="267"/>
        <head>Another, by the same <persName>John</persName>.</head>
        <head>224 — xiv.</head>
        <div type="section">
          <ab n="1">Let us believers hasten to partake of<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a1" target="#n1" n="1"/> and to receive the good things set ready : for it is the quickening body<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a2" target="#n2" n="2"/> and blood of <persName>Jesus</persName> [who is<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a3" target="#n3" n="3"/> God. From above he has prepared himself and set himself before us in <pb n="268"/> invisible fashion, that we may receive [forgiveness for<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a4" target="#n4" n="4"/> the sins that we have committed. Knowing<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a5" target="#n5" n="5"/> therefore that we are partaking of the new and heavenly life, let us all with the cherubim and seraphim and the spiritual ranks sing a song of victory, saying, <quote>Halleluyah!</quote></ab>
        </div>
      </div>
      <noteGrp>
        <note xml:id="n1" target="#a1" n="1"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 267, n. 3</orig></choice> Heb. ii, 14.</note>
        <note xml:id="n2" target="#a2" n="2"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 267, n. 4</orig></choice> John vi, 53, 54.</note>
        <note xml:id="n3" target="#a3" n="3"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 267, n. 5</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>the Son of</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n4" target="#a4" n="4"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 268, n. 1</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>for the forgiveness of</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n5" target="#a5" n="5"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 268, n. 2</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>As men who know</quote>.</note>
      </noteGrp>
    </body>
